 is the only cell in that                                                       
 table a release may move, and here only the version token in it moved. Read    
 `CONTRIBUTING.md`'s                                                            
 Releases section next, then the release entry in `CHANGELOG.md`; each states a 
 claim a reviewer can check                                                     
 against the release's own documents.                                           
                                                                                
